# Run XcodeGen when project structure changes

This project uses [XcodeGen](https://github.com/yonaskolb/xcodegen) to generate `CameraApp.xcodeproj` from `project.yml`. The Xcode project file is not manually maintained.

## When to run

Run `make generate` (or `xcodegen generate`) from the `ios-app/` directory **after any change that affects which files are in the project**, including:

- Adding a new `.swift` file
- Deleting a `.swift` file
- Moving or renaming a `.swift` file
- Changing `project.yml`

## How to run

```bash
cd ios-app && make generate
```

## Important

- Do **not** skip this step — the Xcode project will be out of sync and the build will fail if new or removed files aren't reflected.
- Do **not** manually edit `CameraApp.xcodeproj`. All project configuration lives in `project.yml`.
